Package: y2turf
Title: Efficient Algorithms for TURF Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Adam", "Hubbs", , "adam@y2analytics.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast TURF (total unduplicated reach and frequency) analysis.
    Finds the combinations of products that reach the most respondents by
    building them up in batches, refined with swap searches, rather than
    scoring every possible combination. The search is implemented in Rust.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
  R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
  cli,
  rlang,
  tibble
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
